@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram

[*] --> AddGoods
AddGoods : entry/add new goods
AddGoods : do/add new goods to inventory
AddGoods : exit/after adding new goods

state UpdatePrice
UpdatePrice : entry/update price of existing items
UpdatePrice : do/update the price of existing items in the inventory
UpdatePrice : exit/after updating the price

state RemoveGoods
RemoveGoods : entry/remove goods from inventory
RemoveGoods : do/remove goods from inventory
RemoveGoods : exit/after removing goods

state CheckExpiry
CheckExpiry : entry/check expired goods
CheckExpiry : do/identify expired goods and notify user
CheckExpiry : exit/after checking expired goods

state PlaceOrder
PlaceOrder : entry/place an order to a supplier
PlaceOrder : do/generate invoice for the order
PlaceOrder : exit/after placing the order

state SearchItems
SearchItems : entry/search for items available in the inventory
SearchItems : do/select items for purchase
SearchItems : exit/after selecting items

state CalculateDiscountAndTax
CalculateDiscountAndTax : entry/calculate applicable discount and tax
CalculateDiscountAndTax : do/calculate discount and tax based on selected items
CalculateDiscountAndTax : exit/after calculating discount and tax

state GenerateReceipt
GenerateReceipt : entry/generate receipt for the customer
GenerateReceipt : do/generate receipt after purchase
GenerateReceipt : exit/after generating receipt

state ReplaceOrCancel
ReplaceOrCancel : entry/replace an item or cancel the receipt during billing process
ReplaceOrCancel : do/replace an item or cancel the receipt
ReplaceOrCancel : exit/after replacing or cancelling the receipt

state RecordRequests
RecordRequests : entry/record customer requests for items that may not be currently available
RecordRequests : do/record customer requests
RecordRequests : exit/after recording customer requests

state ViewTransactions
ViewTransactions : entry/view a summary report of all transactions carried out in the system
ViewTransactions : do/view a summary report of all transactions
ViewTransactions : exit/after viewing the summary report

[*] --> UpdatePrice
UpdatePrice --> RemoveGoods
RemoveGoods --> CheckExpiry
CheckExpiry --> PlaceOrder
PlaceOrder --> CalculateDiscountAndTax
CalculateDiscountAndTax --> GenerateReceipt
GenerateReceipt --> ReplaceOrCancel
ReplaceOrCancel --> [*]
CheckExpiry --> RemoveGoods
RemoveGoods --> SearchItems
SearchItems --> CalculateDiscountAndTax
CalculateDiscountAndTax --> GenerateReceipt
GenerateReceipt --> ViewTransactions
ViewTransactions --> [*]
@enduml
